Hey @all!

I just encountered the same error. I found a workaround by installing a former version of igraph where the edge argument is not deprecated (see here <https://r.igraph.org/news/index.html#igraph-160>).

pak::pkg_install("igr...@1.6.0")

@chris, do you plan on updating the braingraph package to work with the igraph >2.0.0?

Cheers,
Lionel

